
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This directory contains the pointing history, efficiency function and list of
detected objects for the CFEPS presurvey block (Jones et al. 2006, Icarus),
observed in the R filter.

The content of this directory is:

CFEPS_presurvey
   \---------- README.cfeps_presurvey (this file) Describes the content of
    \                                   the directory
     \-------- pointings.list           Pointing and time of the presurvey
      \                                 block
       \------ presurvey-smooth.eff     Efficiency function for the presurvey
        \----- CFEPS_presurvey.detections List of objects really detected in
                                        the presurvey (K02O/K02P designations),
                                        with their dynamical class if known,
                                        magnitude at detection, rate of motion,
                                        H mag, and more.

See CFEPS_g/README.formats for the format of a survey "block".

